@baseUrl = http://localhost:5197
@token = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_EXISTING_SESSION
@idTurno = 10
@solicitudId = 6b1f67d0-584a-4a95-88dd-c61c43d61fe5

### Solo ejecutar solicitudes de impresion contra fixture aislada o ingreso real autorizado.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RetiroVehiculos/{{idTurno}}/impresiones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"solicitudId":"{{solicitudId}}","anchoMm":80}

### Consultar la misma solicitud sin imprimir de nuevo.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RetiroVehiculos/impresiones/{{solicitudId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recuperar ultima solicitud; 204 si no existe.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RetiroVehiculos/{{idTurno}}/impresiones/ultima
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}